        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I'm still on neovim 0.9.4, so `H.get_buf_lsp_clients()`  will call `vim.lsp.buf_get_clients` (returns a map)  instead of `vim.lsp.get_clients` (returns a list)\r\n\r\nI've just tried to change from vim to neovim several days before, so I still don't understand my whole lsp server setting (seems to auto configured with mason?). But I think if we attach several different lsp server for the same file type, then the bug will show up almost surely on neovim version < 0.10",
